<section id="faq" class="bg-surface" aria-label="Frequently asked questions">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-10">Frequently asked</h2>
    <div class="divide-y divide-line border-t border-line">
      <details class="group">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer py-5 text-lg font-semibold text-ink list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Does it work with poor internet?</summary>
        <div class="pb-5 text-body leading-relaxed">[ANSWER: truthful for current build.]</div>
      </details>
      <details class="group">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer py-5 text-lg font-semibold text-ink list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Who owns our data?</summary>
        <div class="pb-5 text-body leading-relaxed">You do. [Add "You can export it" only if true.]</div>
      </details>
      <details class="group">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer py-5 text-lg font-semibold text-ink list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Is our students' data safe?</summary>
        <div class="pb-5 text-body leading-relaxed">Each school's data is kept separate, sign-in is by secure email link, and access depends on role. [Edit to match reality.]</div>
      </details>
      <details class="group">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer py-5 text-lg font-semibold text-ink list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What will it cost after the pilot?</summary>
        <div class="pb-5 text-body leading-relaxed">[ANSWER or "Pilot schools get first notice and a founder discount."]</div>
      </details>
      <details class="group">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer py-5 text-lg font-semibold text-ink list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can we import our existing student lists?</summary>
        <div class="pb-5 text-body leading-relaxed">[Answer "yes" only once import works; otherwise "Bulk import is coming during the pilot."]</div>
      </details>
      <details class="group">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer py-5 text-lg font-semibold text-ink list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Do you handle report cards and fees?</summary>
        <div class="pb-5 text-body leading-relaxed">Not yet. They are on our roadmap, and pilot schools help decide the order.</div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
